The bug is caused by the potential for an uninitialized pointer to be passed to the `free` function if the execution jumps to the error handling section before the `config->groups` pointer is initialized. This can occur when `groups_len` is zero or if the mutex initialization fails, leading to improper cleanup and memory management.

